# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Trustfile — Trust boundaries and integrity invariants for my-lang
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>
#
# Defines what LLM/SLM agents are trusted to do without asking, and
# integrity invariants that verify the repo has not been tampered with.

@abstract:
Trust boundaries and integrity checks for my-lang. Defines what AI agents may do
autonomously and what requires human approval, plus checks that verify
repository integrity (no secrets, correct provenance, pinned containers).
@end

## Trust Levels

my-lang operates at trust level: maximal

Trust levels:
- maximal:    Agent may read, build, test, lint, format, heal freely.
             Only destructive/external actions require approval.
- standard:   Agent may read and build. Test/lint need approval.
- restricted: Agent may read only. All modifications need approval.
- minimal:    Agent may read specific files only. Everything else blocked.

Current trust level: maximal

## Integrity Invariants

### Secrets

#### no-secrets-committed
- description: No credential files in repo
- run: test ! -f .env && test ! -f credentials.json && test ! -f .env.local && test ! -f .env.production
- severity: critical

#### no-private-keys
- description: No private key files committed
- run: "! find . -name '*.pem' -o -name '*.key' -o -name 'id_rsa' -o -name 'id_ed25519' 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

#### no-tokens-in-source
- description: No hardcoded API tokens in source
- run: "! grep -rE '(api[_-]?key|secret|token|password)\s*[:=]\s*[\"'\\''][A-Za-z0-9]{16,}' --include='*.rs' --include='*.ml' --include='*.scm' --include='*.ncl' . 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: critical

## Provenance

#### author-correct
- description: Git author matches expected identity
- run: "git log -1 --format='%ae' | grep -qE '(hyperpolymath|j\\.d\\.a\\.jewell|paraordinate)'"
- severity: warning

#### license-content
- description: LICENSE contains the expected identifier (MPL-2.0)
- run: grep -q 'MPL' LICENSE
- severity: warning

## Sensitive-Area Trust

### sensitive-areas-clean-tree
- description: Sensitive scaffold areas should not carry unreviewed modifications
- run: test -z "$(git status --short .machine_readable/ 2>/dev/null | grep -v '^??' || true)"
- severity: advisory
- notes: Changes to .machine_readable/ require careful review

### trust-deny-areas
- description: Sensitive areas require explicit approval before autonomous change
- run: echo "Check proofs/verification, .machine_readable contractiles, governance docs, ANCHOR"
- severity: advisory
- areas:
  - proofs/verification/
  - .machine_readable/
  - GOVERNANCE.adoc
  - MAINTAINERS.adoc
  - .github/CODEOWNERS
  - ANCHOR.scope-arrest.2026-01-01.Jewell.scm

## Container Security

#### container-images-pinned
- description: Containerfile uses pinned base images
- run: test ! -f Containerfile || grep -q 'cgr.dev\|@sha256:' Containerfile
- severity: warning

#### no-dockerfile
- description: No Dockerfile (use Containerfile)
- run: test ! -f Dockerfile
- severity: warning
